---
import Icon from "../Icon.astro";
import { getLang, t, localePath } from "../../i18n/utils";
import { demoUrl } from "../../config";
const lang = getLang(Astro.currentLocale);
---
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wash"><i class="w1"></i><i class="w2"></i><i class="w3"></i></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pip"></span>{t(lang, "为国际课程学校打造的 AI 思考陪练", "An AI thinking partner for IB schools")}</div>
    <h1>
      {lang === "zh"
        ? <Fragment><span class="soft">别人帮学生更快地</span>完成作业。<br />我们帮学生更深地<span class="em">完成思考</span>。</Fragment>
        : <Fragment><span class="soft">Others help students finish</span> faster.<br />We help students think <span class="em">deeper</span>.</Fragment>}
    </h1>
    <p class="lead">{t(lang,
      "学生带着真实的问题进来，和 AI 一起把思考走深。全过程被记录、被评估——最后长成一枚只属于他自己的思维印记。",
      "Students bring a real question and think it through with AI. Every step is recorded and evaluated — until it becomes an imprint of how they think."
    )}</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-lg btn-accent" href={demoUrl}>{t(lang, "体验 Demo", "Try the demo")}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-lg btn-outline" href={localePath(lang, "/evaluation")}>{t(lang, "了解评估模型", "See the model")}</a>
    </div>
    <p class="reassure">{t(lang, "无需注册 · 以示例学生身份走完整流程", "No sign-up — walk the full flow as a sample student")}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="stage reveal" data-tabs>
    <div class="tabs">
      <button class="tab on" data-tab="1"><span class="n">1</span><Icon name="cards" />{t(lang, "召唤工具卡", "Summon a card")}</button>
      <button class="tab" data-tab="2"><span class="n">2</span><Icon name="chat" />{t(lang, "陪练引导", "Coaching")}</button>
      <button class="tab" data-tab="3"><span class="n">3</span><Icon name="spark" />{t(lang, "过程评估", "Evaluation")}</button>
    </div>

    <div class="window">
      <div class="win-bar">
        <div class="tl"><b style="background:#F0685C"></b><b style="background:#F5BF4F"></b><b style="background:#62C554"></b></div>
        <div class="win-title">{t(lang, "思维印记 · 工作区 · Phoebe", "Mind Imprint · Workspace · Phoebe")}</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Panel 1: summon a card -->
      <div class="panel on" data-panel="1">
        <div class="cols">
          <div class="chat">
            <div class="greet">{t(lang, "中国是否让地球变得更可持续？· 进行中", "Is China making the planet more sustainable? · In progress")}</div>
            <div class="msg you">{t(lang, "我想引用这篇公众号文章当证据。", "I want to cite this article as evidence.")}</div>
            <div class="msg ai">{t(lang, "先别急着用它。这条信息你打算拿来说明什么？我们一起把来源溯清楚。", "Before you use it — what do you want it to prove? Let's trace the source first.")}</div>
            <div class="card">
              <div class="tag"><Icon name="cards" />{t(lang, "建议工具卡", "Suggested card")}</div>
              <h4>SIFT × CRAAP{t(lang, " · 横向找更多来源", " · Read laterally")}</h4>
              <p>{t(lang, "Stop · Investigate 找出独立来源并判定可信度 · Trace 溯到原始出处。", "Stop · Investigate the source · corroborate independently · Trace to the origin.")}</p>
              <div class="acts">
                <span class="chip go">{t(lang, "打开这张卡", "Open card")}</span>
                <span class="chip later">{t(lang, "暂不，先继续", "Not now")}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tree">
            <div class="tree-head"><h5>{t(lang, "过程树", "Process tree")}</h5><span class="ro">{t(lang, "只读", "read-only")}</span></div>
            <div class="tree-sub">{t(lang, "边做边长，评估时自动收拢", "Grows as you work")}</div>
            <div class="tree-wrap">
              <div class="spine"></div>
              <div class="node c1"><div class="k">{t(lang, "提问", "Question")}</div><div class="t">{t(lang, "中国是否让地球更可持续？", "Is China making Earth more sustainable?")}</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Panel 2: coaching (one question at a time) -->
      <div class="panel" data-panel="2">
        <div class="cols">
          <div class="chat">
            <div class="greet">{t(lang, "让步段四步 · 以退为进 · 现在轮到你想", "Concession · four steps · your turn")}</div>
            <div class="actcard">
              <div class="st"><span class="dot"></span>{t(lang, "现在轮到你想", "Your turn to think")}</div>
              <div class="qstep done"><div class="lbl"><Icon name="check" class="tick" />{t(lang, "① 你的中心论点", "① Your claim")}</div><div class="q">{t(lang, "中国在可再生能源上的投入正在改变全球格局。", "China's renewables push is reshaping the global picture.")}</div></div>
              <div class="qstep now"><div class="lbl">{t(lang, "② 反方最强的那个事实", "② The strongest counter-fact")}</div><div class="q">{t(lang, "挑对方最难反驳的那一条——越强，你的让步越有分量。", "Pick the hardest one to rebut — the stronger it is, the more your concession weighs.")}</div></div>
              <div class="qstep"><div class="lbl">{t(lang, "③ 先承认它", "③ Concede it")}</div></div>
              <div class="qstep"><div class="lbl">{t(lang, "④ 再转折反驳", "④ Then rebut")}</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="msg ask"><div class="one"><Icon name="target" />{t(lang, "一次只问一个", "One question at a time")}</div>{t(lang, "反方最强的那个事实是什么？先写下来，别急着反驳。", "What's the strongest counter-fact? Write it first — don't rebut yet.")}</div>
            <div class="helpc"><Icon name="help" />{t(lang, "工具说明书 · 我不懂为什么", "How this tool works · why am I doing this?")}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tree">
            <div class="tree-head"><h5>{t(lang, "过程树", "Process tree")}</h5><span class="ro">{t(lang, "只读", "read-only")}</span></div>
            <div class="tree-sub">{t(lang, "边做边长，评估时自动收拢", "Grows as you work")}</div>
            <div class="tree-wrap">
              <div class="spine"></div>
              <div class="node c1"><div class="k">{t(lang, "提问", "Question")}</div><div class="t">{t(lang, "中国是否让地球更可持续？", "Is China making Earth more sustainable?")}</div></div>
              <div class="node c2"><div class="k">{t(lang, "溯源 · SIFT", "Sourcing · SIFT")}</div><div class="t">{t(lang, "溯到 NASA / Nature Sustainability", "Traced to NASA / Nature Sustainability")}</div></div>
              <div class="node c3"><div class="k">{t(lang, "让步段 · 进行中", "Concession · active")}</div><div class="t">{t(lang, "撞上反例：碳排放全球第一", "Counter: #1 in total emissions")}</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Panel 3: evaluation reveal -->
      <div class="panel" data-panel="3">
        <div class="evalp">
          <div class="eval-head">
            <span class="spark"><Icon name="spark" /></span>
            <div><h4>{t(lang, "你的思维印记", "Your Mind Imprint")}</h4></div>
          </div>
          <div class="eval-sub">{t(lang, "最强的模型读完整个过程 · 覆盖十个维度 · 只给学生本人看", "The strongest model reads the whole process · ten dimensions · private to the student")}</div>
          <div class="faces">
            <div class="face drive">
              <div class="fh"><span class="fi"><Icon name="compass" /></span><span class="ft">{t(lang, "生成式驾驭", "Generative drive")}</span></div>
              <div class="imp-row"><span class="name">{t(lang, "提问清晰度", "Clarity")}</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:76%;background:var(--primary)"></i></div><span class="lv" style="color:var(--primary)">L3 {t(lang, "熟练", "Prof.")}</span></div>
              <div class="imp-row"><span class="name">{t(lang, "论证质量", "Argument")}</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:58%;background:var(--amber)"></i></div><span class="lv" style="color:var(--amber)">L2 {t(lang, "发展中", "Dev.")}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="face guard">
              <div class="fh"><span class="fi"><Icon name="shield" /></span><span class="ft">{t(lang, "批判式防护", "Critical guard")}</span></div>
              <div class="imp-row"><span class="name">{t(lang, "横向验证", "Lateral")}</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:92%;background:var(--green)"></i></div><span class="lv" style="color:var(--green)">L4 {t(lang, "卓越", "Adv.")}</span></div>
              <div class="imp-row"><span class="name">{t(lang, "AI 边界与伦理", "AI limits")}</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:74%;background:var(--green)"></i></div><span class="lv" style="color:var(--green)">L3 {t(lang, "熟练", "Prof.")}</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="narr">
            <div class="q"><Icon name="spark" />{t(lang, "过程叙述", "Process narrative")}</div>
            {lang === "zh"
              ? <Fragment>你没有直接采用那篇文章，而是<b>溯到 NASA 与 Nature Sustainability</b> 两个独立原始来源——横向验证做得很扎实。当你撞上「碳排放全球第一」这个反例时，你<b>主动接住了它</b>；下一步可以把让步后的反驳再收紧一点。</Fragment>
              : <Fragment>Rather than using the article directly, you <b>traced it back to NASA and Nature Sustainability</b> — strong lateral reading. When you hit the "#1 emitter" counter-example, you <b>took it head-on</b>; next, tighten the rebuttal that follows the concession.</Fragment>}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
